OL,3,ASam Fender calls out ticket prices
OL,4,Aahead of tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Geordie musician now appears to
OL,7,Fhave lowered the prices and said the
OL,8,F"costs are astronomical compared to two
OL,9,Fyears ago" but he could not control the
OL,10,Fvenue or ticketing fees.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
