OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors left on a knife edge
OL,4,Aafter a trip to the field of screams
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from episode eight of The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,10,FOriginal Celebrity Traitor Maya Jama,
OL,11,Flatest recruit King Kenny and now even
OL,12,Fthe reluctant James Acaster - hooray! -
OL,13,Fhave developed a real appetite for
OL,14,Fmurder this week.
OL,16,FAnd going into Friday's episode we knew
OL,17,Fthat their collective cruel intention
OL,18,Fwas to see that one of three faithfuls,
OL,19,FMiranda Hart, Romesh Ranganathan or
OL,20,FSebastian "Bash" Croft, did not make it
OL,21,Fto breakfast.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
